@startuml
title Запись с оплатой и резервированием анализов\nУспешная оркестрируемая SAGA

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #334155
  LifeLineBorderColor #94A3B8
  LifeLineBackgroundColor white
  ParticipantBorderColor #0B4884
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #1168BD
  ParticipantFontColor white
  ParticipantFontStyle bold
  BoxBorderColor #CBD5E1
  BoxBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  GroupBorderColor #64748B
  GroupBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
}

autonumber

actor "Мобильное\nприложение" as Mobile
participant "External API Gateway\n/ BFF" as BFF
queue "Событийная\nплатформа" as Bus
participant "Интеграционная платформа\nSaga Orchestrator + adapters" as Saga
participant "1С: Полисы" as Policy
participant "Расписание" as Schedule
participant "Платёжный шлюз" as Payment
participant "Payment Webhook\nInbox" as PaymentInbox
participant "LIS" as LIS
participant "Read-модель /\nуведомления" as Projection

Mobile -> BFF: POST /booking-sagas\nIdempotency-Key, access token
activate BFF
BFF -> BFF: проверить JWT и атомарно\nзарегистрировать Idempotency-Key
BFF -> Bus: StartBookingSaga(operationId)
BFF --> Mobile: 202 Accepted, operationId
deactivate BFF

Bus -> Saga: доставить StartBookingSaga
activate Saga
note over Saga
  Состояние SAGA и исходящие команды
  фиксируются через transactional outbox.
  Все изменяющие вызовы получают
  производный идемпотентный ключ.
end note

Saga -> Policy: verifyPolicy(operationId:policy)
Policy --> Saga: policy VALID

Saga -> Schedule: reserveDoctorSlot\n(operationId:appointment)
Schedule --> Saga: appointmentReservationId
note over Saga, Schedule
  Hold врача: TTL 15 минут.
  Saga timer закрывает abandoned payment;
  неизвестный результат сверяется через
  GET payment status/reconciliation.
end note

Saga -> Payment: createPaymentIntent\n(operationId:payment)
Payment --> Saga: paymentId, paymentUrl
Saga -> Bus: PaymentActionRequired(operationId, paymentUrl)
Bus -> Projection: обновить read-модель операции

Mobile -> BFF: GET /operations/{operationId}
BFF -> Projection: прочитать состояние
Projection --> BFF: PENDING_PAYMENT, paymentUrl
BFF --> Mobile: PENDING_PAYMENT, paymentUrl

Mobile -> Payment: подтвердить оплату
Payment -> PaymentInbox: подписанный webhook CAPTURED
PaymentInbox -> PaymentInbox: проверить подпись и\nдедуплицировать eventId
PaymentInbox -> Saga: PaymentCaptured(operationId, paymentId)

Saga -> LIS: reserveLabSlot(operationId:lab)
LIS --> Saga: labReservationId

Saga -> Schedule: confirmAppointment\n(appointmentReservationId,\noperationId:appointment-confirm)
Schedule --> Saga: appointment CONFIRMED

Saga -> Bus: BookingSagaCompleted(operationId)
deactivate Saga
Bus -> Projection: обновить read-модель и отправить push

Mobile -> BFF: GET /operations/{operationId}
BFF -> Projection: прочитать состояние
Projection --> BFF: SUCCEEDED, booking details
BFF --> Mobile: SUCCEEDED, booking details

@enduml
